  "weekly/figures/greenhouse-precession.svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 900 315\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-family=\"Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"title desc\"><title id=\"title\">원판과 세차 원뿔</title><desc id=\"desc\">왼쪽은 태양 방향과 원판 법선 사이 각 z, 오른쪽은 공통 축 N 주위에 반각 epsilon_p로 놓인 고정 태양 방향 S와 세차하는 법선 Z이다. 태양 방향은 공간에서 고정된다.</desc><defs><marker id=\"arrow\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"7\" refY=\"4\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 1L7 4L0 7\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\"><path d=\"M65 240H390\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><path d=\"M225 240V55\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><path d=\"M270 60 225 240\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/><path d=\"M320 60 275 240M370 60 325 240\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/><path d=\"M225 120Q240 120 250 128\"/><path d=\"M660 263 562 90M660 263 762 93\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/><path d=\"M660 263V45\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><ellipse cx=\"660\" cy=\"88\" rx=\"103\" ry=\"29\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 5\"/><path d=\"M660 190Q683 184 698 194\"/><path d=\"M637 64Q681 54 710 70\" marker-end=\"url(#arrow)\"/></g><g font-size=\"23\"><text x=\"210\" y=\"43\">Z</text><text x=\"246\" y=\"116\">z</text><text x=\"330\" y=\"42\">S</text><text x=\"143\" y=\"280\">black disk</text><text x=\"548\" y=\"76\">Z</text><text x=\"770\" y=\"86\">S</text><text x=\"651\" y=\"32\">N</text><text x=\"674\" y=\"181\">εₚ</text><text x=\"674\" y=\"49\">φ</text></g></svg>",
